{"entry_index":0,"uid":"zhcn:aec7f517574eb1ae5a7da06c","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"决胜服是旅行的搭档……我也是很爱惜它的。","source_fingerprint":"dbf53882c1bd974addcc45c60679c7e96a4f244e4a08f33ac69dd17ef294f481","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1135","70009"],"target_text":"Trang phục đua là người bạn đồng hành trong những chuyến đi…… Mình cũng rất trân trọng nó.","reviewed":true},
{"entry_index":1,"uid":"zhcn:ae4688894aae32af04717be5","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"被误认成跳级生了呢。我顺势点头承认了。","source_fingerprint":"a8130bd30e96de81e312a2817e3e196a9467fbce22561fa90ac4ef80ac29f56f","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1135","70010"],"target_text":"Mình bị nhầm là học sinh nhảy lớp. Thế là mình thuận theo mà gật đầu nhận luôn.","reviewed":true},
{"entry_index":2,"uid":"zhcn:e719cf3e946dac815a8b1892","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"喔——明明是夹克却很柔软……。","source_fingerprint":"db687c1f02db44ae25a48a34cb7f9a6b8ff1b6a47725f993cf28a773056cdb76","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1135","70014"],"target_text":"Ồ——rõ ràng là áo khoác mà lại mềm thật…….","reviewed":true},
{"entry_index":3,"uid":"zhcn:545a81b2882b08d148880bda","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"在环境恶劣的地方奔跑时，护目镜是必需品。","source_fingerprint":"657d1e3c21017a4c75e58ef63ef5ff2d13dfe8adf3bddbcbc2435fc07e85517b","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1135","70015"],"target_text":"Kính bảo hộ là vật không thể thiếu khi chạy ở những nơi có môi trường khắc nghiệt.","reviewed":true},
{"entry_index":4,"uid":"zhcn:813c2d7b8097dacbee9f3e1f","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"你还真是个怪人啊。","source_fingerprint":"220bcff1c1d490706dd1bfaa066ebb4be86be383ab92214f946cd6fb4a8c5b08","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1135","70018"],"target_text":"Bạn đúng là người kỳ lạ thật đấy.","reviewed":true},
{"entry_index":5,"uid":"zhcn:b72b6b332ffe74ce9335285d","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"……还要继续吗？","source_fingerprint":"e6e408edf9156548ae948f625ac0cc433732c40b3692a25e9b51a4fde8fd12a3","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1135","70019"],"target_text":"……Vẫn muốn tiếp tục sao?","reviewed":true},
{"entry_index":6,"uid":"zhcn:6a5dba161406e9adac001801","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"嗯，果然很通风。","source_fingerprint":"52d1d4cd4d7bb9d58eedbfc085a37d043504f49209889a1f120b53b9e1001bf9","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1135","70020"],"target_text":"Ừm, quả nhiên rất thoáng.","reviewed":true},
{"entry_index":7,"uid":"zhcn:412b934f9aac3474e0b55588","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"有想去的地方吗？","source_fingerprint":"1d261d8556cd08319e825d782cbb43bceb583f77ee82b1c0184b9965afdeadc8","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1135","70021"],"target_text":"Có nơi nào bạn muốn đến không?","reviewed":true},
{"entry_index":8,"uid":"zhcn:5a3a5aade98c3bd8ac031dd3","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"我当然会穿哦。……毕竟，我是“赛马娘”嘛。","source_fingerprint":"11cf7b907b9203fdfedf76da68654987e46c9e4aaea8b8a19c7987c5848622d6","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1135","71004"],"target_text":"Tất nhiên mình sẽ mặc chứ. ……Dù sao thì mình là một “Mã Nương” mà.","reviewed":true},
{"entry_index":9,"uid":"zhcn:46c8178b8723216974a34307","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"穿着整齐的衣装跳舞，还挺壮观的呢。","source_fingerprint":"c26df972b9ca9d2f685f323e2eacf0ad27a1f85d1b803c49bb0b8dc3e4777e2e","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1135","71008"],"target_text":"Nhảy múa trong những bộ trang phục chỉnh tề trông cũng khá hoành tráng nhỉ.","reviewed":true},
